     "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<h3>Features</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Aglilex 7 F-series 24C package FPGA with 2x F-tiles</li>\r\n<li>Supports entire available density in the package:<br>\r\n027/022, 023/019, 014/012 and 008/006</li>\r\n<li>One 400-pin high performance mezzanine connector</li>\r\n<li>32 FGT transceivers (32.45Gbps NRZ/58Gbps PAM4)</li>\r\n<li>Up to 42 SE 1.2V and 12 true-diff LVDS I/Os</li>\r\n<li>Integrated quad core ARM A53 processing complex with Ethernet, UART, SPI, I2C interfaces and I/Os</li>\r\n<li>Integarted Skyworks Si1518 timing synchronizer based PTP/1588 with JESD clocking support</li>\r\n<li>Max10 Board Module Controller (BMC)</li>\r\n<li>Industrial temp design, -40C to 85C</li>\r\n<li>Compact 110mm x 95mm form factor</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>BSP and Design Support</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>BSP and design support</li>\r\n<li>Complete Linux BSP support package</li>\r\n<li>Comprehensive APIs for board management</li>\r\n<li>Quartus reference projects</li>\r\n<li>Carrier boards design guide for custom carrier designs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
    "container_2142884278": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "backgroundColor": "#f7f7f7",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "1717498052331",
      "1717498053499"
     ],
     "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<h3>Target Markets</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5G/ORAN and Satcom wireless systems</li>\r\n<li>Embedded high performance edge AI/ML systems</li>\r\n<li>Signal processing and image processing</li>\r\n<li>400/200G/100G/50G/40G/25G/10G networked signal processing devices and platforms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
